    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 125,
        "endIndex": 244,
        "text": "### **Candidate [3]: OpenAI Announces GPT-6.1 Sol**\n* **What is confirmed:** OpenAI officially launched **GPT-6.1 Sol**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 246,
        "endIndex": 517,
        "text": "Positioned as an upgrade to GPT-6 Sol, OpenAI claims the model delivers agentic coding, computer use, and professional reasoning approaching flagship GPT-6 Astra levels at one-fifth of the API token price ($2.00 per million input tokens, $10.00 per million output tokens)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 519,
        "endIndex": 660,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Performance and cost-efficiency claims rely on vendor benchmarks and initial third-party automated evaluation suites"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
